{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 233,
    "dDurationMs": 3971,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we're seeing here is water\ncontaminated with sulfuric acid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4204,
    "dDurationMs": 1468,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and toxic metals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5672,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Better known as acid mine drainage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8942,
    "dDurationMs": 3804,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there are thousands of abandoned mines\nscattered across the American West,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12779,
    "dDurationMs": 3303,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each with the potential\nto release contaminated water into vital"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16082,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rivers, lakes and water supplies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19152,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, NASA instruments are providing\na crucial solution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23123,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By mapping surface minerals from space,\nthey can identify"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26626,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the exact regions in need of remediation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30063,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But first, a bit of a science lesson."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32732,
    "dDurationMs": 3804,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The process of acid mine drainage is\nwhen rocks that have been underground"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36536,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get dug up and exposed to the surface. \nWhen they're exposed to the surface,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40707,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are now subject to getting rained on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43543,
    "dDurationMs": 2636,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they're exposed to water,\nthey're exposed to air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46179,
    "dDurationMs": 3237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in that process,\nthey actually convert that water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49416,
    "dDurationMs": 3903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is flowing over them\ninto much more acidic waters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53319,
    "dDurationMs": 2436,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they also can release toxic metals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56389,
    "dDurationMs": 3771,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now certain types of rocks do experience\nthis kind of weathering naturally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60260,
    "dDurationMs": 3537,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, this process unfolds much slower\nsince rocks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63797,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make their way to the Earth's surface\nover incredibly long timescales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68101,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when we extract the minerals\nneeded to power our technologies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71571,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these rocks are pulled to the surface\nat a much faster rate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75075,
    "dDurationMs": 4104,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we really expedite\na lot of that weathering in that process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79245,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are an estimated 50,000 mines across"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82248,
    "dDurationMs": 3137,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the American West that have yet\nto be assessed for remediation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85618,
    "dDurationMs": 2636,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, can be very expensive\nto do so on the ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88254,
    "dDurationMs": 968,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ROCKET LAUNCH SOUNDS"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89222,
    "dDurationMs": 4738,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Launched in 2022, NASA's EMIT\ninstrument is an imaging spectrometer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93993,
    "dDurationMs": 4071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a NASA invention that is used to measure\nlight that is both in the visible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98064,
    "dDurationMs": 2569,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and infrared wavelengths."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100633,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An imaging spectrometer is basically kind of like a really fancy camera. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104304,
    "dDurationMs": 433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "CLICK"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104771,
    "dDurationMs": 4204,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So your camera has a red, green, and blue channel. And those are often"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108975,
    "dDurationMs": 4037,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really broad channels. But light is a continuum,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113012,
    "dDurationMs": 1769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it reflects at all these different wavelenghts. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114781,
    "dDurationMs": 4071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so if you can measure them in narrower and narrower intervals, "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118852,
    "dDurationMs": 4471,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You get more and more information about exactly how light is "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123323,
    "dDurationMs": 5105,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interacting with the chemical surface and the properties of whatever it is that it’s reflecting off of. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128495,
    "dDurationMs": 1601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By using spectroscopy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130096,
    "dDurationMs": 2636,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instruments like EMIT can map large regions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132732,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to detect mineral compositions\nindicative of acid mine drainage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136236,
    "dDurationMs": 3937,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and its sources.\nAnd it's not just for rocks and minerals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140473,
    "dDurationMs": 3871,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spectroscopy can be used to greatly\nbroaden our understanding of our world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145512,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s like a Swiss Army knife."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147347,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are so many things\nthat people can use it for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149716,
    "dDurationMs": 2102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are doing things\nwhere people are looking at waste"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151818,
    "dDurationMs": 2469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "water, people are looking at surface\nplastics and agriculture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154287,
    "dDurationMs": 2936,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People are looking at crop types\nand thinking about yields."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157223,
    "dDurationMs": 3704,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as with all NASA data,\nthis information is free"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160927,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and open to the public. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163096,
    "dDurationMs": 4337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we are, we really encourage people\nto check them out and think about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167433,
    "dDurationMs": 501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167934,
    "dDurationMs": 3704,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they might want to be leveraging them\nfor a variety of, of different activities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408341,
    "dDurationMs": 1101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, certain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409442,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "types of rocks do experience\nthis kind of weathering naturally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413279,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, this process unfolds much slower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416449,
    "dDurationMs": 2803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since rocks\nmake their way to the Earth's surface over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419252,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "incredibly long timescales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424991,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with that expedites"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426659,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lot of the weathering in the process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529662,
    "dDurationMs": 2769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we're seeing here is water\ncontaminated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532431,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with sulfuric acid and toxic metals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534834,
    "dDurationMs": 2202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Better known as acid mine drainage."
    } ]
  } ]
}
